  "details": "Description\n\nI keep losing sound. It has gotten worse today.  I lose audio minutes aftr I enter a world. I restart my headset to get audio back only to lose again after a feew minutes. I have a Quest 3 headset.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nI don't know why it keeps happening. I restart headset and the sound goes back out. I don't know any other way to get around the sound loss.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Audio\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p2-1938-565822d00a-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
